---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Disclosure under § 25 MedienG: name and place of residence.
const owner = 'Thomas Hochörtler';
const residence = 'Kindberg, Austria';
---
<Base title="Imprint & privacy">
  <article class="imprint">
    <h1>Imprint &amp; privacy</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        hochitom.rocks is my private catalogue of Hard Rock Cafe pins. It has no ads, sells nothing and is not
        connected to Hard Rock Cafe in any way.
      </p>
      <p>Disclosure under § 25 MedienG (Austrian Media Act):</p>
      <p class="disclosure">
        {owner}<br />
        {residence}
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted by Netlify. When you open a page, Netlify’s servers receive the usual request data, such
        as your IP address, the page you asked for, the time and your browser’s user agent, and keep it in server logs
        for a short time to deliver the site and keep it secure. Netlify processes this data on my behalf;
        see <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify’s privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        To see how many people visit and which pins they look at, I use Cloudflare Web Analytics. It sets no cookies,
        stores nothing on your device and does not track you across sites; it only counts page views in aggregate.
        That is why there is no cookie banner.
        See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The fonts are served from this site itself, so your browser makes no requests to Google or any other font
        service. There are no contact forms, comments or accounts, so I collect nothing else about you.
      </p>
      <p>
        You have the right to information, correction, deletion and restriction of processing, and you can complain to
        the Austrian data protection authority (Datenschutzbehörde).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <p>
        The continents on the globe come from <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/">Natural Earth</a>, which is
        in the public domain.
      </p>
      <p>
        The coordinates of the cafes were looked up with OpenStreetMap: © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under
        the Open Database License. See <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">openstreetmap.org/copyright</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Hard Rock Cafe is a trademark of its owner. The pins and photos are from my own collection.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .imprint {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    padding: 0 var(--gutter) 40px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font: 900 clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, var(--text-h1)) / 0.95 var(--display);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  section {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  h2 {
    font: 800 var(--text-h3) / 1.2 var(--display);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--brass);
  }
  p {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
  }
  .disclosure {
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brass);
  }
</style>
